// v125 · 귀여운 움직이는 이모티콘: 큰 이모지가 통통·흔들·둥실·말랑 움직이고 주변에 반짝이·하트가 떠다닙니다.
function cuteEmoji125(x, d, W, H, t) {
  let R = Math.min(W, H) / 2,
    anim = d.anim || "bounce",
    dx = 0,
    dy = 0,
    rot = 0,
    sx = 1,
    sy = 1;
  if (anim === "bounce") {
    let p = (t % 0.9) / 0.9,
      up = Math.sin(p * Math.PI);
    dy = -up * R * 0.22;
    sy = p < 0.12 || p > 0.9 ? 0.88 : 1;
    sx = 2 - sy;
  } else if (anim === "wiggle") rot = Math.sin(t * 7) * 0.22;
  else if (anim === "float") {
    dy = Math.sin(t * 2.2) * R * 0.1;
    rot = Math.sin(t * 1.1) * 0.08;
  } else if (anim === "jelly") {
    sx = 1 + Math.sin(t * 8) * 0.09;
    sy = 1 - Math.sin(t * 8) * 0.09;
  } else if (anim === "beat") {
    let b = t % 0.8;
    sx = sy = 1 + 0.14 * Math.exp(-b * 10) + 0.08 * (b > 0.2 ? Math.exp(-(b - 0.2) * 10) : 0);
  } else if (anim === "spin") rot = Math.sin(t * 1.6) * Math.PI * 0.15 + t * 0.6;
  else if (anim === "wave") {
    rot = Math.sin(t * 5) * 0.3;
    dx = Math.sin(t * 5) * R * 0.04;
  }
  // 파스텔 동그라미 배경
  if (d.bg) {
    x.save();
    x.beginPath();
    x.arc(0, 0, R * 0.86, 0, Math.PI * 2);
    let g = x.createRadialGradient(-R * 0.3, -R * 0.3, R * 0.1, 0, 0, R * 0.9);
    g.addColorStop(0, "#ffffff");
    g.addColorStop(1, d.bg);
    x.fillStyle = g;
    x.shadowColor = d.bg;
    x.shadowBlur = R * 0.35;
    x.fill();
    x.restore();
  }
  // 주변 장식
  let deco = d.deco || "✨";
  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
    let a = (i / 5) * Math.PI * 2 + t * 0.7,
      tw = 0.5 + 0.5 * Math.sin(t * 3 + i * 1.9),
      dist = R * (0.95 + 0.08 * Math.sin(t * 2 + i));
    x.save();
    x.globalAlpha *= 0.35 + 0.65 * tw;
    emoji125(x, deco, Math.cos(a) * dist, Math.sin(a) * dist * 0.85, R * (0.16 + 0.08 * tw));
    x.restore();
  }
  // 그림자
  x.save();
  x.globalAlpha *= 0.25;
  x.fillStyle = "#000";
  x.beginPath();
  x.ellipse(0, R * 0.78, R * 0.42 * (1 + dy / R), R * 0.08, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);
  x.fill();
  x.restore();
  x.save();
  x.translate(dx, dy + R * 0.05);
  x.rotate(rot);
  x.scale(sx, sy);
  emoji125(x, d.emoji || "🐰", 0, 0, R * 1.15);
  x.restore();
  if (d.text) {
    font125(x, 900, R * 0.3, d.text, W * 0.95);
    x.textAlign = "center";
    x.textBaseline = "middle";
    x.lineJoin = "round";
    x.lineWidth = R * 0.12;
    x.strokeStyle = "#ffffff";
    x.strokeText(d.text, 0, R * 0.82);
    x.fillStyle = d.ink || "#ff6fa5";
    x.fillText(d.text, 0, R * 0.82);
  }
}
// 파스텔 말랑 이모티콘 글자 (｡•ᴗ•｡)
function kaomoji125(x, d, W, H, t) {
  let wob = 1 + Math.sin(t * 4) * 0.03;
  x.save();
  x.scale(wob, 2 - wob);
  rr125(x, -W / 2, -H / 2, W, H, H / 2);
  x.fillStyle = gradient125(x, d.color, d.color2, -W / 2, -H / 2, W / 2, H / 2);
  x.shadowColor = d.color;
  x.shadowBlur = H * 0.3;
  x.fill();
  x.shadowBlur = 0;
  x.lineWidth = H * 0.05;
  x.strokeStyle = "rgba(255,255,255,0.9)";
  x.stroke();
  x.restore();
  let text = d.text || "(｡•ᴗ•｡)";
  font125(x, 800, H * 0.42, text, W - H * 0.5, '"Segoe UI Symbol","Malgun Gothic","Apple SD Gothic Neo","Noto Sans KR",sans-serif');
  x.textAlign = "center";
  x.textBaseline = "middle";
  x.fillStyle = d.ink || "#6b3b5a";
  x.fillText(text, 0, H * 0.03 + Math.sin(t * 4) * H * 0.02);
  for (let i = 0; i < 2; i++) {
    let tw = Math.max(0, Math.sin(t * 3 + i * 2));
    x.save();
    x.globalAlpha *= tw;
    emoji125(x, d.deco || "💕", (i ? 1 : -1) * (W / 2 - H * 0.05), -H * 0.45, H * 0.32);
    x.restore();
  }
}
